# VHS tape recording for EvoKernel v0.4.0 Live Demo
Output assets/demo.gif

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 740
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 24

Type "# 1. Instant 0-Overhead Context & Fragility X-Ray (<25ms)"
Enter
Type "npx evo-kernel score"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3.5s

Type "# 2. One-Command Cold-Start Gene Mining & Multi-Harness Setup"
Enter
Type "npx evo-kernel init --stealth && npx evo-kernel virtualize --dry-run"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "# 3. Export Self-Contained Interactive EvoKernel Workbench"
Enter
Type "npx evo-kernel ui --export ./evo-workbench.html"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
